  4→{"type":"consensus","id":"C4","text":"Prime factorization makes consistency local. evalLiteral_true_iff_literalSharesFactor is sorry-free.","source":"both","exchange":9,"date":"2026-03-13"}
  5→{"type":"consensus","id":"C5","text":"AssignmentFreeSAT ↔ standard SAT is proven sorry-free in Decomposition.lean.","source":"both","exchange":9,"date":"2026-03-13"}
  6→{"type":"consensus","id":"C6","text":"The conditional entropy chain rule decomposes H(CNF) clause-by-clause.","source":"both","exchange":10,"date":"2026-03-13"}
